C++程式語言片段如下，程式由行號1執行到行號9後，下列敘述何者正確？
1 enum States { Run = 1, Stop, Pause = 3, Exit };
2 States StateMachine = Pause;
3 int Command = 0;
4 std::cin >> Command;
5 if (Command == 1) StateMachine = Stop;
6 if (Command == 2 && StateMachine == Pause)
7 StateMachine = Run;
8 if (Command == 3 || StateMachine ==Stop)
